# Agent Rules

Five agents — do not collapse into one:

1. RAG Analyst — business Q&A, approved tools only
2. Evaluator — quality scoring, separate from query path
3. Ingestion / Schema Mapping — propose-only mappings
4. Routing / Sensitivity — local vs cloud decisions
5. Ops / Maintenance — internal evals and observability

- One agent module per task; no multi-agent refactors in a single pass.
- RAG Analyst must never call ingestion, config, or raw SQL tools.
- Prompt YAML edits are Red Zone — propose diffs only.
